      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STRINGER LASS (1) hasn't raced since June but has been readied with two trials, winning the latest. The ace draw gives her every chance to make a winning return. CALM LEGEND (7) made an encouraging return when second at Parkes over 1660m last week, her first run for nearly three months. Fitter for that and drawn to enjoy a nice run. If he gets the gaps she can certainly take this out. NAVIE JO (4) drew on the back row and came from a long way back last start for second, beaten 3.5 metres, in a nice return to form at Parkes. Likely to get the favours from this nice draw so is capable of winning. BROOKLYNS GEM (6) showed pleasing improvement last time out when runner-up at Canberra. Could go on with it.",
